    ["5月25日\n　　雪下了一整晚。早上起来帐篷都被埋了半截，尼尔提议我们提早启程加快行程，考虑到意外情况，补给可能不太够。\n我们把东西都收拾好，准备启程。\n\n剩余物资：\n面包3份\n肉干和肉肠2份\n糖1罐 尼尔昨晚外出了一趟，回来的时候吃了几颗\n黄油2块 山上太冷，我们昨晚把黄油涂抹在面包上，并且放在火上烤着吃\n酒1瓶 水太重了，只留一瓶等登顶后庆祝\n水3瓶"] = "May 25th\n　　It snowed all night. When we woke up in the morning, the tent was half-buried. Neil suggested we set off early to speed up the journey; considering unexpected situations, the supplies might not be enough.\nWe packed everything up and prepared to set off.\n\nRemaining supplies:\nBread: 3 portions\nDried meat and sausages: 2 portions\nSugar: 1 jar (Neil went out last night and ate a few pieces when he returned)\nButter: 2 blocks (It was too cold on the mountain, so we spread the butter on the bread last night and roasted it over the fire to eat)\nWine: 1 bottle (Water is too heavy, so we only kept one bottle to celebrate after reaching the summit)\nWater: 3 bottles",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>秘银锻甲・骑士战铠\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mithril Forged Armor/Knight Battle Armor\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
